    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should ask my doc but i wont see him for like 3 weeks and i really love my grapefruit juice. i read online somewhere that it's fine as long as you don't drink a whole gallon of it lol. is there like a certain amount that's safe or is it totally off limits? i just dont want to deal with the stomach thing too.",
